    {
      "subId": "1915901",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191590197"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191590197": {
            "id": "191590197",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Do you know about \"The Great Machine\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590198"
            ]
          },
          "191590198": {
            "id": "191590198",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Could you talk about quadruple-orbit shift?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590199"
            ]
          },
          "191590199": {
            "id": "191590199",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can you briefly describe the application of the law of triple-orbit shift calculation?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1915907",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191590701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191590701": {
            "id": "191590701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Okay, I should get started on those notes. If there's anything you're curious about, you may go ahead and ask now. I can answer you as I write! I'm used to multi-tasking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590702"
            ]
          },
          "191590702": {
            "id": "191590702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Oh, and I have to ask a favor. When you give the notes to her later, please don't tell her about my existence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590703"
            ]
          },
          "191590703": {
            "id": "191590703",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why's that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590704"
            ]
          },
          "191590704": {
            "id": "191590704",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Hmm, well, she's always been in a fragile state. If she knew that there was another \"Layla\" who's always taking care of everything...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590705"
            ]
          },
          "191590705": {
            "id": "191590705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "She might feel like everything she's ever worked for is pointless, and that could lead to some demoralizing thoughts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590706"
            ]
          },
          "191590706": {
            "id": "191590706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "She's a resilient girl, but no matter how resilient she may be, no one can hold up to criticism and torment from themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590707"
            ]
          },
          "191590707": {
            "id": "191590707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "If her condition grows any worse, it's possible that I might cease to exist as well. Then there wouldn't be anyone to help her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590708"
            ]
          },
          "191590708": {
            "id": "191590708",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But she's not doing very well now, either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590709"
            ]
          },
          "191590709": {
            "id": "191590709",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "She's getting better, though, isn't she? It's apparent how hard she's working now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590710"
            ]
          },
          "191590710": {
            "id": "191590710",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "She's my source of knowledge. I'm merely the representation of how she would be if she were rested and healthy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590711"
            ]
          },
          "191590711": {
            "id": "191590711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "I believe that she's one of the best, even in a place like the Akademiya, where geniuses come by the handful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590712"
            ]
          },
          "191590712": {
            "id": "191590712",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "But growth is a process and shouldn't be rushed. I will always believe in and support her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590713"
            ]
          },
          "191590713": {
            "id": "191590713",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's good that she has you, or she might've already hit rock bottom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590714"
            ]
          },
          "191590714": {
            "id": "191590714",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Hahaha, believe me, even if she were to end up at rock bottom, she'd find a way to somehow laugh it off as one of her silly mistakes and climb her way out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590715"
            ]
          },
          "191590715": {
            "id": "191590715",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "That's the kind of person she is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590716"
            ]
          },
          "191590716": {
            "id": "191590716",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Alright, I've written down all the possible questions that I think the advisers might ask. Next, I'll put together a few words of encouragement for her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191590717"
            ]
          },
          "191590717": {
            "id": "191590717",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "I'm not going to sign it, obviously. Oh, and don't forget about our agreement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1915908",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191590801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191590801": {
            "id": "191590801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Azzam",
            "text": "You're quite welcome. It makes me happy to see my equipment being used to its potential."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
